          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Affordable. Quiet. Extremely dark.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affordable. Quiet. Extremely dark."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Недорого. Тихо. Крайне темно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After all that, Pig finally knew exactly what he wanted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After all that, Pig finally knew exactly what he wanted."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "После всего этого Pig наконец точно знал, чего хочет."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alleys, rooftops and a pig on the loose. Pizza on the pavement, trash cans along it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alleys, rooftops and a pig on the loose. Pizza on the pavement, trash cans along it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Переулки, крыши и свинья на свободе. Пицца на тротуаре, мусорные баки вдоль него."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And make sure to close the fence. Pig is keeping his options open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And make sure to close the fence. Pig is keeping his options open."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "И не забудь замкнуть забор. Pig пока рассматривает и другие варианты."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "And that was it. Pig had toured every market imaginable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "And that was it. Pig had toured every market imaginable."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вот и всё. Pig повидал все рынки жилья, какие только можно представить."
