    "Bonus tiles add points. Penalty tiles take points away. Try to fence in the bonus and leave the penalty out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonus tiles add points. Penalty tiles take points away. Try to fence in the bonus and leave the penalty out."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Бонусные клетки добавляют очки, штрафные — отнимают. Постарайся огородить бонусы, а штрафные оставить снаружи."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them found a gap and showed themselves out. Follow the trails and close them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them found a gap and showed themselves out. Follow the trails and close them."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Оба нашли лазейку и откланялись. Проследи, куда они ушли, и заделай дыры."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but %@'s never touches the water. He keeps a breathing hole, so his ground has to lie against it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but %@'s never touches the water. He keeps a breathing hole, so his ground has to lie against it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но загон, где живёт %@, не касается воды. Ему нужна полынья, так что его земля должна к ней примыкать."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but it is the same place. %@ wants its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but it is the same place. %@ wants its own."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но одно на двоих. %@ хочет своё."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but no channel is wholly %@'s. Every bank of one channel has to be his own ground — half a wallow is nobody's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but no channel is wholly %@'s. Every bank of one channel has to be his own ground — half a wallow is nobody's."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но %@ не владеет целиком ни одной протокой. Все берега одной протоки должны быть его землёй — пол-лужи ничьи."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one each. %@ goes where Pig goes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one each. %@ goes where Pig goes."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но у каждого своё. %@ хочет быть там же, где Pig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one is bigger. %@ wants ground to match Pig's.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one is bigger. %@ wants ground to match Pig's."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но одно больше. %@ хочет столько же земли, сколько у Pig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but one wall does for both — and %@ stings straight through a fence. Leave clear ground between them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but one wall does for both — and %@ stings straight through a fence. Leave clear ground between them."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но стена у них общая — а %@ жалит прямо сквозь забор. Оставь между ними свободную землю."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both of them have a place, but side by side. Pig's ground has to go the whole way round %@ — and it is ground she walks, so she needs a clear path the whole way round, with nothing she cannot cross breaking it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both of them have a place, but side by side. Pig's ground has to go the whole way round %@ — and it is ground she walks, so she needs a clear path the whole way round, with nothing she cannot cross breaking it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Место есть у обоих, но они просто соседи. Земля Pig должна полностью окружать %@ — а Pig по ней ходит, так что ему нужен свободный путь по всему кругу, и ничто непроходимое не должно его прерывать."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both parties requested a little distance.": {
