    },
    "The eagle sees everything directly above, below, and beside it. Everything.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The eagle sees everything directly above, below, and beside it. Everything."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Орёл видит всё прямо над собой, под собой и сбоку от себя. Всё."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full game": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The full game"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Полная версия"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The knock and the little buzz as fencing goes in, a pen holds, or the pig gets away, and the waltz under it all. Sounds and music follow the ring/silent switch on the side of the phone, and the music stays out of the way of anything you already have playing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The knock and the little buzz as fencing goes in, a pen holds, or the pig gets away, and the waltz under it all. Sounds and music follow the ring/silent switch on the side of the phone, and the music stays out of the way of anything you already have playing."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Стук и лёгкая вибрация, когда встаёт забор, закрывается загон или свинья сбегает, и вальс под всем этим. Звуки и музыка подчиняются переключателю звонка/бесшумного режима сбоку телефона, а музыка не мешает тому, что у тебя уже играет."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The listing described it as \"lush.\" That was generous.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The listing described it as \"lush.\" That was generous."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "В объявлении было написано «пышная зелень». Это было щедро."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lot was enormous. Shade was sold separately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The lot was enormous. Shade was sold separately."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Участок был огромный. Тень продавалась отдельно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The meadow and today's daily puzzle are free, and every world past the meadow opens a level a day. Unlock all of them at once, and the whole archive — once, for good.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The meadow and today's daily puzzle are free, and every world past the meadow opens a level a day. Unlock all of them at once, and the whole archive — once, for good."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Луг и сегодняшняя головоломка дня бесплатны, а в каждом мире за лугом открывается по уровню в день. Открой их все сразу и весь архив в придачу — один раз и навсегда."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The month after": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The month after"
